    "Name": "Fafnir II",
    "Details": "Originating after the 17th battle of Hesperus II, the Fafnir II is the designation given to a limited production run of custom Fafnir's created with battlefield salvage. Built by Defiance Industries, the 100 ton Fafnir II FNR2-5-B is powered by a 300-rated XL Engine and protected by 21 tons of Ferro-Lamellor armor. A pair of Gauss Rifles form the primary armament supported by a quad of Light PPC’s and a pair of Streak LRM-10’s. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
